    "question": "Marianne was 20 years old when Bella was 8 years old. How old will Marianne be when Bella turns 18?",
    "gold": "30",
    "answer": "Marianne is 20 - 8 = <<20-8=12>>12 years older than Bella.\nBella will turn 18 in 18 - 8 = <<18-8=10>>10 years.\nSo, Marianne will be 20 + 10 = <<20+10=30>>30 years old then.\n#### 30"
