  "generation": {
    "text": "To determine how old Marianne will be when Bella turns 18, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Determine the age difference between Marianne and Bella.\n2. Calculate how many years it will take for Bella to turn 18.\n3. Add this number of years to Marianne's current age.\n\nStep 1: Determine the age difference between Marianne and Bella.\nMarianne was 20 years old when Bella was 8 years old. The age difference is:\n\\[ 20 - 8 = 12 \\]\nSo, Marianne is always 12 years older than Bella.\n\nStep 2: Calculate how many years it will take for Bella to turn 18.\nBella is currently 8 years old, so it will take:\n\\[ 18 - 8 = 10 \\]\nyears for Bella to turn 18.\n\nStep 3: Add this number of years to Marianne's current age.\nMarianne is currently 20 years old, so in 10 years, Marianne will be:\n\\[ 20 + 10 = 30 \\]\nTherefore, when Bella turns 18, Marianne will be \\boxed{30} years old.",
